<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal insurance premium income rises Jan-Nov.</title>
<headline>Portugal insurance premium income rises Jan-Nov.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Income from Portuguese insurance premiums rose a year-on-year 19.2 percent in the period January to November to 697.5 billion escudos, the Association of Portuguese Insurers (APB) said.</p>
<p>(Figures in billions of escudos):</p>
<p>			    Jan-Nov 96		   Jan-Nov 95</p>
<p>    Life premiums	307.1			    230.7</p>
<p>    Non-life premiums  390.4			    354.3</p>
<p>    Total premiums     697.5			    585.0</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +(351-1) 3538254</p>
</text>
